==Walkthrough==
===Exterior===
Between the two curved exterior stairwells that lead up to the building itself, there is a blue chest, three large sacks, and a smaller sack which are all set as non-respawning containers and can thus be safely used for storage.

===High Hrothgar===
Once you have completed [[Skyrim:The Horn of Jurgen Windcaller|The Horn of Jurgen Windcaller]], you can safely take any items from within High Hrothgar. If you later kill Paarthurnax during the quest [[Skyrim:Paarthurnax (quest)|Paarthurnax]], taking items here will then be counted as stealing.

